DAY 01
History of java:
Java was invented in 1995 by james Gosling at sun microsystems
The first name of java was Oak 
It changed it java due to trademark issues 
The project name was Project Green 
The prototype name is Oak

The main goal of java is “write once, run anywhere”
Programming languages like C, C++ were used to run only in single device at a time 
Java runs on different devices without changing the code


JVM:
Java virtual machine runs the java programs 
Program converted into Byte code and executed 

JRE:
Java runtime environment provides a platform to run java programs 
JRE contains libraries required to run java program 

JDK:
Java development kit is used to develop a java program 
It helps to write, compile and run java programs
